  "authoringReviewNotes": [
    "The workbook described SSPR/writeback as prerequisites. Current Microsoft guidance says the secure Conditional Access password-change flow itself does not use SSPR; MFA registration is required and hybrid users require working password writeback.",
    "Do not automatically retire the High-user-risk policy. Medium-only risk scope does not itself establish High-risk coverage.",
    "Deployable JSON uses the current v1.0-supported passwordChange + mfa AND grant shape. The retained-source authenticationStrength relationship is recorded as a compatibility normalization for final library review."
